{"id":"tuido-7f6eaf","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-cf0df35c-4abc-4a3d-a152-e17390e003a6","text":"Implemented: `demo/demo.tape` (VHS script, throwaway `HOME`, tasks seeded off-camera), `make demo` target (builds release first, then `vhs demo/demo.tape`), the GIF embedded under the README intro, and re-recording steps under Local Development. Rendered `demo/demo.gif` is 328 KB, about 25 s, 1100×600, Catppuccin Mocha.\n\nDeviation from the spec: the build moved out of the tape into the `make demo` prerequisite, because a cold `cargo build` inside the hidden section was racing the recording."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T13:28:59.412195Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
